# Keep shared public defaults in tracked .env and mode settings in tracked .env.dev/.env.fat/.env.production.
# Builds work without local files. Optional .env.<mode>.local is only for temporary personal overrides.
# Local overrides are ignored; .env.local is unsupported. Do not put platform-private values in this open-source core.
# VITE_* and provider values defined by Vite become public browser code.
# Provider keys are only suitable for trusted, local BYOK use.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=
# OPENAI_MODEL=
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-editor.example.com
# URDF_STUDIO_DEV_HOST=127.0.0.1
# Optional related-product URLs; no deployment endpoints are assumed.
# VITE_BOTWORLD_URL=https://assets.example.com
# VITE_MOTION_STUDIO_URL=https://motion.example.com
